" Mai says. \"This is my mother, and this is my father. My father is a teacher.\" Mai has a brother, Huy. Huy is a student too. Grandma Hoa lives with them. She has a cat, Kiko. \"Kiko loves Grandma,\" Mai says. Tom laughs. \"I have a big family in Canada. I have two sisters and a dog.\"","question":"Where is Tom's family?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"In Canada\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Gia đình của Mai\".","id":"u2n7l2-e09","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Where is Tom's family?"},"skillIds":["reading","u2.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","imageAssetId":"i.u2.mother","text":"mother"},{"id":"c2","imageAssetId":"i.u2.family","text":"family"},{"id":"c3","imageAssetId":"i.u2.sister","text":"sister"},{"id":"c4","imageAssetId":"i.u2.brother","text":"brother"}]},"explanation":"\"sister\" = \"chị gái\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"chị gái\" là \"sister\".","id":"u2n7l2-e10","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Hình nào là \"chị gái\"?"},"skillIds":["u2.vocab"],"type":"imageChoice","vocabularyIds":["u2.sister"]},{"content":{"pairs":[{"id":"p1","left":{"id":"p1l","text":"son"},"right":{"id":"p1r","text":"con trai"}},{"id":"p2","left":{"id":"p2l","text":"dog"},"right":{"id":"p2r","text":"con chó"}},{"id":"p3","left":{"id":"p3l","text":"father"},"right":{"id":"p3r","text":"bố"}},{"id":"p4","left":{"id":"p4l","text":"cousin"},"right":{"id":"p4r","text":"anh chị em họ"}},{"id":"p5","left":{"id":"p5l","text":"aunt"},"right":{"id":"p5r","text":"cô"}}]},"explanation":"son = con trai; dog = con chó; father = bố; cousin = anh chị em họ; aunt = cô","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctPairIds":["p1","p2","p3","p4","p5"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Ví dụ: \"son\" = \"con trai\".","id":"u